Description: visual control panel for KDE Plasma
 Painel de Controle provides a visual way to open KDE Plasma settings on desktop computers and laptops.
 Clicking a device in the picture (mouse, keyboard, display, speakers,
 network, printer, camera and so on) or in the side list opens the matching
 KDE Plasma settings modules through kcmshell6. "Advanced Mode" opens the
 complete System Settings.
 .
 The interface follows the language of the Plasma session.
